#: ../../zh/triton_api_extension/al/subview.md:5
msgid "昇腾硬件 A5 支持了定义新视图，仅通过偏移、大小和步幅实现，不复制底层数据。"
msgstr "Ascend hardware A5 supports defining new views, implemented only through offsets, sizes, and strides without copying underlying data."
"Ascend A5 hardware supports defining new views using only offsets,"
"sizes, and strides, without copying the underlying data."

